WEBVTT

NOTE
The X-ATM092 chase through Dollet's streets.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 14 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Evening in Dollet, narrow street through an archway X-ATM092, a spider-like robot, approaches

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
X-ATM092, a spider-like robot, enters Dollet, its massive legs smash shops, stomp cars, and rampage down the street

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
They reach Dollet’s open beach, the archway collapses, and X-ATM092 towers over the buildings, stunned by the impact, while Squall also falls behind

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000 
Zell and Selphie run ahead, Squall still trailing behind
  
00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
Selphie stands, glancing back in worry for Squall, while Zell throws open the ship’s doors for escape

00:23.000 --> 00:32.000
X-ATM092 recharges, stands, and charges after Squall. 

00:32.000 --> 00:37.000
POV from the robot’s camera tracks his sprint. The chase continues as Squall runs toward the ship, which starts to move

00:37.000 --> 00:39.000
Zell signals Squall to jump

00:39.000 --> 00:42.000
Squall leaps in a slow-motion jump of faith toward the ship

00:42.000 --> 00:45.000
Quistis opens fire from a mounted machine gun on one of the extraction ship , driving back the robot.
 
00:45.000 --> 00:47.000
Squall lands on the ship

00:47.000 --> 00:48.000
Quistis continues firing

00:48.000 --> 00:50.000
X-ATM092, ship-sized, grabs ship with force

00:50.000 --> 00:55.000
Metal parts from the X-ATM092 fly as it’s blasted by the cannon, X-ATM092 finally falls, destroyed and steaming  

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
Finally safe, Quill glances at the destroyed X-ATM092 as the ship takes off and the door closes, relieved

01:00.000 --> 01:07.000
The ship pulls away fast from the shore, leaving the steaming X-ATM092 behind on the beach, which finally explodes in a burst of fire

01:07.000 --> 01:12.000
The ship continues hovering over the calm waters, drifting into the sunset